    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Binary writer backed by a caller-provided fixed-capacity memory buffer. Inherits string-writing helpers from <ref refid="classONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1utils_1_1StringWriteStream" kindref="compound">StringWriteStream</ref> but never reallocates. Throws std::runtime_error if a write would exceed the initial capacity. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
